"s_per_word": 0.262, "s_per_letter": 0.068, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.971, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "76762f1911636f1f27aeca49ddd47cbcb0cd670fb59158e7ac99538f222184b5", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/003.flac"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 16, "idx": 4, "text_idx": 24, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 165, "letters": 745, "chars": 979, "max_new_tokens": 1434, "t_start": 1790296994.172, "latency": 33.168, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 2565252, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "f45d725e24f74bf0a7334818a4c02db0", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "5", "x-baseline-batch-id": "59", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "5.6", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "8.1", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "33084.0", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "668", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "239", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "1434", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "1434", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "hit", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 1434}, "params": {}, "text": "Okay, okay, we have a lot to cover, so let's go, let's go. Hotels, doing great. Golf courses, doing great, record numbers. Restaurants, fantastic, people are lining up around the block. The new tower, ahead of schedule, under budget, nobody's ever done that. The ratings, through the roof, bigger than ever. The steaks, the best steaks, everybody's talking about them. The water, beautiful water, crystal clear. The vodka, well, we don't talk about the vodka. But everything else, winning, winning, winning. I could go on for hours, I really could, but they tell me we only have a few minutes, so I'm going fast, very fast, faster than anybody's ever gone. Is that fast enough? I think that's fast enough. Nobody talks faster than me, believe me. Nobody. Oh, and the golf, record rounds, beautiful rounds, the best rounds. The ties, beautiful ties, very long ties. The hats, everybody wants the hats. The books, bestsellers, all of them, every single one. Okay, next, next, next.", "audio_s": 53.44, "rtf": 0.621, "s_per_word": 0.324, "s_per_letter": 0.0717, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 1.025, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "e7b40bc5e15b5e9e54f604ba98519c2c85464a3db23995ee2920d4f60922f335", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/004.flac"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 16, "idx": 5, "text_idx": 25, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 109, "letters": 427, "chars": 567, "max_new_tokens": 833, "t_start": 1790296994.174, "latency": 56.204, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1378692, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "f4ed0fae153b4c478609cdcb4ff0f48a", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "60", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "33074.1", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "2.3", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "23018.3", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "359", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "141", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "833", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "944", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "hit", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 833}, "params": {}, "text": "Let me tell you something, and I want you to listen. There are people out there, competitors, who think they can beat us. They think they can take what we built. Let me be very clear. That's not going to happen. Not today, not tomorrow, not ever. We know who they are. We know what they're doing. And when the time comes, we will be ready. We are always ready. So to those people, I have a very simple message. Don't even try. You'll lose. You'll lose big. And we will win. We always win. They have been warned. This is their only warning. There won't be another one.", "audio_s": 28.72, "rtf": 1.957, "s_per_word": 0.263, "s_per_letter": 0.0673, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.961, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "11162f9c5b7404fb663b619feea6fd688f395e7a25435c2bd0c5d8b348e74667", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/005.flac"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 16, "idx": 6, "text_idx": 26, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 110, "letters": 425, "chars": 571, "max_new_tokens": 829, "t_start": 1790296994.176, "latency": 56.191, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1390212, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "d52a3ea12f024bf2a9a8dbeb4629f0b6", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "60", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "33076.9", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "2.3", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "23018.3", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "362", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "149", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "829", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "944", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "hit", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 829}, "params": {}, "text": "So this guy comes up to me, a little guy, very nervous, and he goes, oh, Mister Trump, Mister Trump, please, please, can I have a picture? Can I have a picture with you? And I said, sure, of course. And he says, oh, thank you, thank you so much, my wife is never going to believe this! Oh my goodness! And his voice was going higher and higher, like this, oh, Mister Trump, you're my hero! I thought he was going to faint. Very nice guy. Very nice. But a very high voice. Later I found out he sings opera. Soprano. Makes sense, actually. Beautiful voice. Very, very high.", "audio_s": 28.96, "rtf": 1.94, "s_per_word": 0.263, "s_per_letter": 0.0681, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.973, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "9a174480ef3b2535b0cddcdcbc935b30e07d3d5a1348600deed977b6b828ed72", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/006.flac"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 16, "idx": 7, "text_idx": 27, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 115, "letters": 455, "chars": 604, "max_new_tokens": 885, "t_start": 1790296994.178, "latency": 33.152, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1432452, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "6ff4139008824b77813ab2759889ef2f", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "5", "x-baseline-batch-id": "59", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "8.6", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "8.1", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "33084.0", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "373", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "150", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "885", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "1434", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "hit", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 885}, "params": {}, "text": "And I said to them, you want the best? You want the very best? Then you came to the right place! Because we don't do small, we don't do average, we do tremendous! We do spectacular! When we build something, the whole world stops and looks. They say, how did they do that? How is that possible? And I tell them, it's possible because we dream big, we work hard, and we never, ever quit! Never! So get ready, folks, because what's coming next is going to be the biggest, the best, the most beautiful thing you've ever seen! Are you ready? I said, are you ready? Because here it comes! Here it comes, folks!", "audio_s": 29.84, "rtf": 1.111, "s_per_word": 0.259, "s_per_letter": 0.0656, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.937, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "16346d65d54f1fd9f2dd0b15841ce90987f31d11a7896c9741b9644b3007e94d", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/007.flac"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c16_n16_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 16, "idx": 8, "text_idx": 28, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 115, "letters": 490, "chars": 635, "max_new_tokens": 952, "t_start": 1790296994.18, "latency": 78.513, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1770372, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "7fd980c2f03c4ad88cc006d3822c3c0f", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "3", "x-baseline-batch-id": "61", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "56094.6", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "1.4", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "22340.9", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "461", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "150", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "952", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "952", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "hit", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 952}, "params": {}, "text": "Okay. They gave me this paper, and they said I have to read it, so I'm going to read it. The terms and conditions of the golf club membership. Section one. Members must wear collared shirts at all times. Section two. Members must replace all divots on the fairway. Section three. Carts must remain on the cart path near the greens. Section four. No outside food or beverages. Okay. Very exciting stuff. Section five. Guests must be accompanied by a member. That's it. That's the paper. I read it. Can I go now? Section six. No running on the greens. Section seven. Members must pay their dues on time. Okay. That's really it this time.", "audio_s": 36.88, "rtf": 2.129, "s_per_word": 0.321, "s_per_letter": 0.0753, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 1.075, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "607efa650e19f3bb250c5bb58476addafea7a2034192184a9c3a342a9282a294", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/008.flac"}
